OpenSCAD bootstrap artifacts
----------------------------
When no supported system OpenSCAD executable is available, the plugin
downloads a pinned OpenSCAD snapshot directly from the official
`files.openscad.org` host. The checked-in bootstrap table records the exact
artifact URL and SHA-256 digest (if that snapshot has been removed upstream,
the newest snapshot is verified against the digest published beside it); the OpenSCAD executable and its bundled
third-party libraries remain under the licenses supplied by the OpenSCAD
project and are not relicensed under AGPL-3.0-only. The downloaded package's
upstream notices are retained in the per-user cache; this repository does not
vendor the platform-specific binary.

AI runtime downloads
--------------------
The optional AI setup downloads the platform's official Node.js v24.21.0
archive from nodejs.org and installs the Pi coding agent v0.87.1 from npm.
Neither runtime is vendored or embedded in this repository; their upstream
license files remain with the installed packages in the per-user cache. Node.js
archives also contain licenses/notices for bundled third-party libraries.

